# SYNTHETIC. Written from RFC 5804 (ManageSieve), with capability lines in the shape a
# Pigeonhole server sends them. Not a recording.
# The server offers STARTTLS and then refuses it. There is no falling back to
# signing in without it.
S: "SASL" "PLAIN"
S: "STARTTLS"
S: OK "ready"
C: STARTTLS
S: NO "TLS is not available right now"
FAIL Unsupported
